### writes made on new are flowing back to old through app_rev (origin = none)
[poll] newest client_seq new=3387 old=3388
old> SELECT subname, apply_error_count FROM pg_stat_subscription_stats
 subname | apply_error_count 
---------+-------------------
 app_rev |                 0
(1 row)

new> SELECT subname, apply_error_count FROM pg_stat_subscription_stats
 subname | apply_error_count 
---------+-------------------
 app_sub |                 2
(1 row)

